      "title": "doc: Fix wsbuglink issue text",
      "message": "doc: Fix wsbuglink issue text\n\nparse_content_as: text always puts the full text inside attrs['text']\nThe \"name_positional_attributes\" statement doesn't do anything.\n(We want to parse as text in case we want to use commas or something.)\n\nRemove that statement and access the bug text. Previously the bugtext\nwas never used, and \"Issue #{issueid}\" was always used.\n",
